The data in this folder (our prompts and the answers of the judges) and our analysis results in code/outputs/
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International licence
(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The non-commercial and share-alike terms follow from ScienceQA (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), parts of which the prompts
contain.

The prompts are built from CALM (Ye et al., ICLR 2025, https://github.com/Y0oMu/LLM-Judge-Bias-Dataset) and the
datasets it draws on, which keep their own terms:

  GSM8K                                   MIT
  MATH                                    MIT
  ScienceQA                               CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  jondurbin/truthy-dpo-v0.1               CC BY 4.0
  jondurbin/py-dpo-v0.1                   CC BY 4.0
  Intel/orca_dpo_pairs                    Apache 2.0
  yleo/emerton_dpo_pairs_judge            no licence stated
  xDAN2099/xDAN-SFT-DPO-Roleplay-NSFW-with-lf   no licence stated

The answers of the LLM judges were generated through the APIs of their providers and are subject to their terms.
